{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["orchard pump maintenance: the market stall reserves a different weekend slot.","orchard pump maintenance: the pruning shed labels another fuel can.","orchard pump maintenance: the crop notebook records a separate bloom date.","orchard pump maintenance: the storage barn reserves another pallet row.","orchard pump maintenance: the field radio uses a different channel card.","orchard pump maintenance: the farm vehicle log records an unrelated tire check.","orchard pump maintenance: the nursery bench holds another grafting tray.","orchard pump maintenance: the pond pump has a separate filter note.","orchard pump maintenance: the orchard kitchen stores unrelated gloves.","orchard pump maintenance: the delivery van follows another pickup route.","orchard pump maintenance: the orchard records an unrelated pollinator habitat inspection.","orchard pump maintenance source record: North orchard pump NP-7 carries asset tag ORC-771. The parts pickup for pump NP-7 is scheduled at the east shed counter. Pump NP-7 uses the blue intake valve during the spring irrigation cycle.","orchard pump maintenance source note: the south orchard tractor receives a separate oil change.","orchard pump maintenance source note: the packing barn scales use another calibration weight.","orchard pump maintenance source note: the west field gate has an unrelated hinge inspection.","orchard pump maintenance source note: the irrigation office files a different permit copy."],"truncate":false}